00:08:48,379 --> 00:09:01,060
Speaker 1: You, unless you look carefully or unless you're like having trouble connecting to like some internal service you were expecting to connect to that would only be accessible by your company VPN, right?

128
00:09:01,561 --> 00:09:05,216
Speaker 1: You might not realize anything's wrong because you didn't actually look to see that.

129
00:09:05,256 --> 00:09:08,891
Speaker 1: you just see that your VPN is on and you trust that and that's good enough for you, right?

130
00:09:08,911 --> 00:09:13,259
Speaker 1: You're not opening up your packet inspector every single time you connect to at a coffee shop.

