00:09:23,421 --> 00:09:25,249
Speaker 0: Option 121, like the thing at issue.

135
00:09:25,812 --> 00:09:27,460
Speaker 0: And it has a section right there.

136
00:09:27,900 --> 00:09:33,940
Speaker 0: Security considerations, potential exposures to attack at the DHCP protocol are discussed in this section.

