502
00:32:02,071 --> 00:32:02,712
Speaker 1: No, it wasn't.

503
00:32:02,772 --> 00:32:14,785
Speaker 1: It was these vertical alternating bars where you could see, mostly at the edges of the monitor, you could see it like this repeating pattern.

504
00:32:14,805 --> 00:32:19,610
Speaker 1: The middle of the monitor was mostly fine, and it was really only visible in grey areas.

505
00:32:19,670 --> 00:32:23,937
Speaker 1: If you put on a different color, like red, you couldn't see it.

506
00:32:23,997 --> 00:32:26,241
Speaker 1: It was only if you put it to grey, then you could really see it.

